    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The creature you hit takes an extra 3d8 Radiant damage from the attack and has the &amp;Reference[blinded apply=false]{Blinded} condition until the spell ends. At the end of each of its turns, the Blinded target makes a Constitution saving throw, ending the spell on itself on a success.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The extra damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3.</p>",
